stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> WarmingUp: first sample
    WarmingUp --> WarmingUp: accept, Welford update, return score None
    WarmingUp --> Scoring: n_burn values accumulated, freeze mu and sigma
    Scoring --> Scoring: accept, return abs(x - mu) / sigma
    Scoring --> WarmingUp: gap longer than max_gap_s and gap_policy is reset
    WarmingUp --> WarmingUp: rejected sample, state unchanged
    Scoring --> Scoring: rejected sample, state unchanged
